Subject: [PATCH] feat: replace n8n chat path with direct OpenAI + add widget
 token auth
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Step 1 — Direct OpenAI integration (chatController.js):
- Replace synchronous n8n webhook call with openai SDK (gpt-4o-mini)
- Add p-queue concurrency guard (max 50 parallel AI calls, 25s timeout)
- Fix DB race condition: persist messages non-blocking after response

Step 2 — Widget token authentication (validateWidgetToken.js):
- New middleware validates x-widget-token header against Business collection
- Server-verified businessId replaces client-supplied businessId in controller
- Inactive widgets return 403; missing/invalid tokens return 401
- Client api.js updated to send x-widget-token from window.__GDWidgetToken

Also:
- Add OpenAI to CSP connectSrc in server.js
- Add server/env.example documenting required environment variables
- Install openai and p-queue packages

https://claude.ai/code/session_01GfTSyDdSRfVxr84qPqbvDJ
